  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Pinkie Flamingo Welcomes You To May's Way On 30A<br>1 King / 2 Queens / Twin Bunks<br><br>It's the most important decision you will make this year! “Where do we stay along 30A?”<br>It's almost as important as “What should I eat for breakfast?” These challenging questions are easily answered. “I love the carrot cake pancakes at First Watch smiled Pinkie. ”They actually make a pancake sound healthy. “When I am “Makin' My Way Along 30A…It's May's Way or No Way!” Pinkie's newest guest nest is an enviable end unit with a 6-seater golf cart at the popular 30A Townhomes Community in Seagrove Beach.<br><br>A slice of old Florida, Seagrove Beach is noted for its central location, its serenity, and its well-balanced mix of dining and attractions. Garnished with graceful live oaks, stately magnolias, oaks and hickory trees and the glimmering reflection off Eastern Lake, recreational opportunities abound here including lake swimming and kayaking. Kayak rentals available lakeside! Just a short golf cart or bike ride to the West and you'll find yourself in Seaside, famous for its white picket fences, collage of food trucks, open amphitheater, outdoor boutiques and local restaurants. County Highway 30A is a winding scenic highway is composed of a diverse array of charming beach communities and quaint eclectic neighborhoods each with its own style and appeal.<br><br>Less than one minute walking distance to the all-new Greenway Station! Whether you need to refresh your home or wardrobe, grab a unique bottle of wine, or try the latest paddleboard to hit the market, find all the essentials for life by the sea. Each of the Greenway Station merchants was carefully selected to offer our guests a one-of-a-kind experience.<br><br>What Pinkie Likes Best About May's Way on 30A<br>•\tGreat Seagrove Location<br>•\tCommunity Pool<br>•\tBeach Gear <br>•\tPrivate Patio Area Out Back<br>•\tFurnished Upstairs Balcony<br>•\tFurnished Balcony<br>•\t1-Car Garage<br>•\tEnd Unit<br><br>Let's Peek Inside…<br>•\tFresh Coastal Decor<br>•\tComfortable Open Living Area <br>•\tDining Table Seats 4 Plus 2 Bar Stools<br>•\tModern Stainless & Granite Fully-Equipped Kitchen<br>•\tFull Size Washer/Dryer<br>•\tCute Bunk Nook w/ Barn Slider Door<br>•\tSleeps 8 in Beds<br><br>“Makin' My Way Along 30A”…Seagrove Beach<br><br>All of Pinkie's Properties Have A Few Things In Common<br>•\tMust Be 25 To Book<br>•\tNo Smoking <br>•\tCancellation OK 30 Days Prior To Check-In<br>•\tSheets & Bath Towels Included…BYO Beach Towels<br>•\tAll Kitchens Fully-Equipped With Cooking/Eating Utensils… BYO Spices & Food<br>•\tBasic Essentials Starter Set Only…TP, Paper Towels, Trash Bags, Soaps, Etc …Depending on Length of Stay You May Need More",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
