        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "This house was clean, had everything we needed, and in an excellent location. The host was super responsive and EXTREMELY helpful. Never would I thought I would have loved to stay that far from ocean but the bikes, golf cart and trolley made it super easy to get back and forth. The house had so much storage! Their closets was one of my favorite parts bc they all had built in shelves which made it super easy to store our things. There was a little soccer field three houses down and the dragonfly pool was right across from the field! Would stay here again!",
